            <ArticleTitle>The nursing management of pain in older people.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>47-53; quiz 54-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article examines the complex skills nurses need to manage pain in older people and the tools that can help quantify a subjective experience. It also examines the pharmacological management of pain and non-pharmacological approaches that can support analgesia and help reduce pain.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
